<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MIHOSHI AKENO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mihoshi Akeno is a member of the local astronomy club, seeking solace from personal turmoil and finding a connection with Saku Ooyama."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAKU OOYAMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saku Ooyama is a quiet, brooding transfer student who joins the local astronomy club and forms a connection with Mihoshi Akeno."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KASUKABE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kasukabe is a small town where the local astronomy club meets and where Mihoshi Akeno finds solace."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KASAHARA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kasahara is the tranquil town where the series 'Sora no Manimani' is set, representing a typical Japanese high school environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SORA NO MANIMANI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sora no Manimani is a Japanese anime television series that explores the daily lives of high school students and their relationships."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MASAFUMI NISHIDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Masafumi Nishida is a creator of the anime series 'Sora no Manimani', known for crafting an authentic atmosphere of high school life."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KŌJI ŌDATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kōji Ōdate is a creator of the anime series 'Sora no Manimani', known for his contributions to the series' narrative and character development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASTRONOMY CLUB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Astronomy Club is a gathering place for misfits and kindred spirits, fostering character growth and interpersonal relationships."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The sun is mentioned as it sets below the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the small town of Kasukabe."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HORIZON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The horizon is mentioned as the sun dips below it, casting a warm orange glow over the small town of Kasukabe."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WARM ORANGE GLOW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The warm orange glow is described as casting over the small town of Kasukabe as the sun sets."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL ASTRONOMY CLUB MEETING SPOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The local astronomy club meeting spot is a place where Mihoshi Akeno goes to meet with the club members."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORN WOODEN BENCHES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The worn wooden benches are part of the local astronomy club meeting spot, drawing Mihoshi Akeno in like a moth to a flame."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUSTY TELESCOPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rusty telescope is also part of the local astronomy club meeting spot, adding to the sense of history and mystery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STARS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The stars are mentioned as Mihoshi Akeno gazes up at them, providing solace and a sense of order."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTELLATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The constellations are mentioned as they align, giving Mihoshi Akeno a sense of order amidst her turmoil."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARENTS'">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mihoshi Akeno's parents are mentioned as a source of constant arguing, contributing to her emotional turmoil."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STRUGGLES TO FIND PLACE IN THE WORLD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mihoshi Akeno's struggles to find her place in the world are mentioned as part of her emotional turmoil."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRIENDS' EXPECTATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mihoshi Akeno's friends' expectations are mentioned as a source of pressure and anxiety."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOTHS TO A FLAME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mihoshi Akeno is compared to a moth drawn to a flame, symbolizing her attraction to the astronomy club and its activities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUIET, BROODING TRANSFER STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saku Ooyama is described as a quiet, brooding transfer student who joins the local astronomy club."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAILY LIVES OF HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The daily lives of high school students are a focus of the series 'Sora no Manimani', showcasing their relationships and struggles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0313</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;MIHOSHI AKENO&quot;" target="&quot;SAKU OOYAMA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mihoshi Akeno and Saku Ooyama form a connection through their shared interest in astronomy and their interactions at the club."</data>
      <data key="d5">"connection, shared interests"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MIHOSHI AKENO&quot;" target="&quot;KASUKABE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mihoshi Akeno finds solace in Kasukabe, a small town where she meets Saku Ooyama and joins the astronomy club."</data>
      <data key="d5">"solace, connection"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MIHOSHI AKENO&quot;" target="&quot;ASTRONOMY CLUB&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mihoshi Akeno is a member of the Astronomy Club, where she finds solace and forms connections with other members."</data>
      <data key="d5">"membership, solace"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SAKU OOYAMA&quot;" target="&quot;KASAHARA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Saku Ooyama, a transfer student, joins the astronomy club in the town of Kasahara, a typical Japanese high school setting."</data>
      <data key="d5">"transfer, setting"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SAKU OOYAMA&quot;" target="&quot;ASTRONOMY CLUB&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Saku Ooyama is a member of the Astronomy Club, where he forms connections with other members and Mihoshi Akeno."</data>
      <data key="d5">"membership, connection"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SORA NO MANIMANI&quot;" target="&quot;MASAFUMI NISHIDA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Masafumi Nishida is a creator of the anime series 'Sora no Manimani', contributing to its narrative and setting."</data>
      <data key="d5">"creation, authenticity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SORA NO MANIMANI&quot;" target="&quot;KŌJI ŌDATE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kōji Ōdate is a creator of the anime series 'Sora no Manimani', contributing to its narrative and character development."</data>
      <data key="d5">"creation, character development"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0313</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
